      "How to cook egg fried rice",
      "",
      "Have you eaten egg fried rice? Can you make egg fried rice?",
      "",
      "Making egg fried rice does not require a lot of ingredients,",
      "You just need a few eggs, some cooked rice, and also some simple seasoning.",
      "",
      "For the first step, we need to stir-fry the eggs.",
      "After beating the eggs, put them in a hot pan with oil and quickly stir-fry until cooked.",
      "Then we put the cooked rice into the pan, and stir-fry it together with the egg for about five minutes.",
      "Finally, add a little bit of salt and green onion, stir-fry a bit more, and a portion of delicious egg fried rice is ready!",
